<title>USA: Strong storm to hit northwest Europe this week-WSC.</title>
<headline>Strong storm to hit northwest Europe this week-WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A very strong storm system will hit northwest Europe late this week, private forecaster Weather Services Corp (WSC) said.</p>
<p>In the North Sea, southwest winds of 20-30 mph (32-48 kph) and gusty are forecast for Thursday and 25-40 mph (40-65 kph) and gusty on Friday. Rough seas are expected.</p>
</text>
